24.4pt"><i><span lang="EN-GB">Ansuya Pachai</span></i><span lang="EN-GB"> and <i>Kerri Kitchura</i>, for the respondent/appellant on cross-appeal the Metropolitan Toronto Chief of Police David Boothby and the respondent the Metropolitan Toronto Police Services Board.</span></p> 
